LPL Timed_Automaton description

  specification description
    part Clocks of sort list[identifier]
        import identifier list[identifier]
    part States of sort list[identifier]
        import identifier list[identifier]
    part Labels of sort list[identifier]
        import identifier list[identifier]
    part Invariant of sort list[invariant]
        import Terms[Clocks,States,Labels]
    part Transitions of sort list[transition]
        import Terms[Clocks,States,Labels]
  end

  query of sort pair[list[statezone],bool]
  result of sort pair[list[statezone],bool]
  import Timed_Automaton[Clocks,States,Labels,Invariant,Transitions]
  start with (TransTimeOperatorStar)query

end

/* examples of queries:

 Transitions_List(nil,s0/true,s2/true) end
 Transitions_List(nil,s0/true,s1/X>5^true) end
*/